    <div class="project-content project-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-anchor-placement="top-center">
        <h2>Fantasy Baseball Draft Helper (In Progress)</h2>
        <p>This Python-based tool helps fantasy baseball players make more informed draft decisions using historical stats and machine learning models.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><p>Scrapes player statistics from FanGraphs and Baseball Savant.</p></li>
            <li><p>Ranks players by projected value across scoring categories using weighted calculations.</p></li>
            <li><p>Includes position scarcity logic and dynamic ranking updates as the draft progresses.</p></li>
            <li><p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, BeautifulSoup.</p></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="project-content project-card" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2>Brokerage Order Manager</h2>
        <p>Designed and implemented an application and a web service for optimized order routing and improved distribution.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><p>Developed a batch processing system to enhance trade path efficiency.</p></li>
            <li><p>Conducted tests to ensure application reliability and responsiveness.</p></li>
            <li><p>Utilized version control, deployment, and advanced dashboards for monitoring and troubleshooting.</p></li>
            <li><p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Spring Boot, JUnit, Cucumber, Postman, Bitbucket, Bamboo, SplunkCloud, Honeycomb</p></li>
